  ("Where can I hear Skrazy and follow his partners on the record?", "On the official visualizer of “Come Here” on YouTube, the only primary page opened for this profile. His handle published in the credits is @s_k_r_a_z_y, quoted here without a link verified by direct opening. The profiles of his partners, <a href=\"/en/dboss.html\">Dboss</a>, maker of the riddim of the record, and <a href=\"/en/ras-b.html\">Ras B</a>, are published on this site, and our <a href=\"/en/playlist-bouyon.html\">bouyon playlist</a> follows the releases of this new wave.")
